Z||000019||Songman||06-21-2001||03:49 AM||||I have had no problems running any software, including games, and no problem with any peripherals, even my off-brand scanner, since the service packs came out for 2000.<P>SP1 was good enough, but with SP2, it is smooth sailing. I bet I have 150 games on my server and they all run like clockwork.<P>But I definitely agree that it is about time Microsoft got something right!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
