Z||000022||Formula88||06-21-2001||12:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>I have had no problems running any software, including games, and no problem with any peripherals, even my off-brand scanner, since the service packs came out for 2000.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, some games won't run on 2000.  Need for Speed is one of them.  Most game companies are making their stuff run on NT/2000 now, so that's becoming less of an issue, but it's something to check before you upgrade.  Since I like Need for Speed, that's one of the reasons I'm on Win98SE instead of 2000.  2000 actually benchmarks faster than 98SE!||||reg||4
Z||000023||Songman||06-21-2001||10:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B> Well, some games won't run on 2000.  Need for Speed is one of them.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Shhhhhh.. Don't tell my computer. It thinks Need For Speed will run on it. Maybe as long as it don't know that W2000 can't run N4S then I can keep playing it on it... heheh<P>Bill... I do have 3Dsound but no multiple monitor.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000024||pHoOl||06-21-2001||11:50 PM||||Here's my two cents worth:<P>microsoft says that you have to have a pentium 133 minimum to run Windows 2000 and they recommend something like a 233mHz.  BULL$HIT!!! i had a pentium 75mHz running with 2000, and let me tell you, it ran faster and more stable than win 98.  Every single piece of hardware was supported (granded it was old).  Most hardware will work with 2K even if it doesn't say it's supported<P>I build myself a new system last year just after 2k was "officially released". Not a single piece of my hardware that i have in my system was supported for win2k, but every single one works.  Haven't had to do any driver updates except for the Voodoo 3 so that i could watch TV.  <P>To make a short story boring... Unless you absolutely have to for file sharing or gaming purposes with other people who use 98... Don't get 98!!! It is very unstable, even se.  Go out and buy 2000, or if you don't have the money "find" it.  (DISCLAIMER: i am not suggesting that you pirate it, as this is illegal and could land you in jail for quite some time) <P>------------------<BR>Ricers are like tampons... Every p@#%y has one.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
